  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Programme on Work and Health, covering the seven countries in Central America. The Agreement Partner is the Swedish Insitute on Working Life (NIWL)and the contribution cover the period 2003-2008. SICA is the regional coordinator and two resource centers are connected to the programme. The overell agreement cover 20 000 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regional insats inom omr&#xe5;det arbete och h&#xe4;lsa innefattande alla 7 l&#xe4;nder i Centralamerika. Insatsen kanaliseras genom svenska  Arbetslivsinstitutet och t&#xe4;cker perioden 2003-2008. Regional samordnare &#xe4;r SICA och tv&#xe5; resurscenter/universitet i regionen knyts till programmet. Avtalet g&#xe4;ller ett st&#xf6;d p&#xe5; 20 000 000 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
